  "details": "A very niche use of the OnPlayerLeft node is to have something happen on the player leaving the world. This was used in a popular map called \"Keep Running\" where leaving would have you surrounded by entities.\n\nHowever, this no longer happens.\n\nUnless, that is, you are closing the game entirely.\n\nBy closing the game entirely you can see that this code still exists in \"Keep Running\" but no longer appears when moving to a different instance or rejoining. This is replicatable for other maps by connecting events to the \"OnPlayerLeft\" node.",
